{"articleNo":"325198","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=325198&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] Job Fair for Int'l Students 2021 / 2021 외국인 유학생 채용박람회 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2021.09.13","hit":"16446","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:black\">We would like to introduce “Job Fair for Int'l Students 2021”\nhosted by NIIED and KOTRA every year.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt;\">We hope that interested students could participate in.</span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:black\"><o:p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:black\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">1. Event: Job Fair for Int'l Students 2021</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:black\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">2. Date/Venue: 2021.10.12.(Tue) ~ 10.13.(Wed) / SETEC Exhibition\nHall 3 (Haknyeoul Station, Seoul)</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:black\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">3. Scale: About 70 Korean companies including Hyundai Mobis</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:black\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">4. Main Event: 1:1 recruitment consultation and video interview\nwith participating companies in Korea, special lecture from senior staffs,\ncompany briefing session and special lecture on residence visa, interview in\nKorean and consulting on employment documents, etc.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:black\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">5. Online pre-registration: until September 23, 2021 through </span><a href=\"http://jobfair.contactkorea.go.kr/\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">http://jobfair.contactkorea.go.kr</span></a><o:p></o:p></span></p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n\n</span><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: black;\">※</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:black\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"> Applicants who wish to be interviewed by the hiring company must\nregister in advance online, and on-site interview is not possible if they do\nnot register in advance.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:black\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: black;\">국립국제교육원과</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\ncolor:black\"> KOTRA</span><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: black;\">가</span><span lang=\"KO\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:\n&quot;Arial&quot;,san